{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t蔡天鳳案在高等法院續審，控方開始結案陳詞。<br/>\n<br/>\n律政司外聘資深大律師、主控郭莎樂指，三名被告各有角色，並按計劃執行。事先買好所需裝備，準備一有機會就動手，形容他們輕鬆、冷靜、無恐慌或悲傷。完全沒有那種如果是突發意外所致、理應出現的厭惡反應。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:03:54.238311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:32:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T05:17:31.528882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:27.138333+00:00","content_hash":"8f9c9c4304786c9a13243d21231a63f0c35a05ab87a05307428607842f7ed3cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}